_:genid13 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> _:genid12 .
_:genid12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
_:genid12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/plato#Type> .
_:genid12 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#List> .
_:genid13 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <https://w3id.org/plato#Timespan> .
