# 
# https://w3id.org/plato#bbox
<https://w3id.org/plato#bbox> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#bbox> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/plato#Geometry> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#bbox> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/plato#bbox> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n        Bounding box as array: [min_lon, min_lat, max_lon, max_lat].\n        Enables fast spatial filtering. Format: comma-separated string\n        or JSON array depending on serialization context.\n    "@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#bbox> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "bounding box"@en .
