<https://w3id.org/plato#bibliographic_string> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A formatted citation string for this source."@en .
<https://w3id.org/plato#bibliographic_string> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "bibliographic string"@en .
